target/

# FL Chan and other sheets are their authors' artwork, not ours to redistribute
# (spec §1.3).
#
# The `.toml` manifests are the exception: measured timings and Motif tags, authored
# here, containing no pixels. They are kept, and they must live beside the PNG
# because that is the only place the loader looks (spec §4.2).
#
# Ignoring `dancer-sheets/` as a *directory* would stop git descending into it, and
# the negations below would never be reached. So ignore the contents and re-include
# directories instead.
dancer-sheets/**
!dancer-sheets/**/
!dancer-sheets/**/*.toml

# ONNX weights, ~10 MB, fetched rather than vendored (spec §8.1).
models/
*.onnx

# The score cache is user data, generated on their machine (spec §5.1).
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal

# Portable layout puts config beside the executable (spec §13).
config.toml
